1	/* ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
2	   Stage3D — the drafting table as a small 3D model.
3	
4	   A team of three works the plot for the whole run: the engineer stakes
5	   the corners and walks the boundary, one architect chalks the setbacks,
6	   the other sketches the zoning, and they keep laying out the column grid
7	   until the engine returns its schemes. Then they draw the real plan room
8	   by room by walking each outline, the walls rise, and the camera settles
9	   to plan view for the hand-off into the review. Every line drawn after
10	   the planning sketch is the engine's own geometry.
11	   ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════ */
