# Hero walkthrough video — Google Flow prompts

One continuous camera move through a dark, premium house, built from four 8-second clips.
Each clip continues from the previous clip's last frame. The hero maps one clip to each scroll chapter:
**01 Arrival → 02 Volume → 03 Ascent → 04 Horizon**.

## Flow settings
- **Model:** Veo 3.1 (Quality). **Aspect:** 16:9. Download at **1080p** (use Flow's upscale).
- **Clip 1:** Text to Video. Make 2–4 takes and pick the one with the steadiest constant-speed glide and a dark centre in the first second, because the site title sits there.
- **Clips 2–4:** Frames to Video, with the previous clip's **last frame as the start frame**, or Scenebuilder → **Extend**, which does the same. Leave the end frame empty. Only add one if a take drifts off-plan and you need to pull it back.
- Paste the **Camera**, **Style** and **Avoid** blocks into every prompt **unchanged**. Repeating them word for word is what keeps the clips consistent.
- Reject any take that has a cut, changes speed in its last second, or has furniture changing shape. Joins only feel seamless when speed and direction match at the boundary.
- Audio doesn't matter; the site plays the video muted.

---

## Blocks to paste into every prompt

**Camera:** One continuous gimbal-stabilised shot at eye level (about 1.5 m), moving at a slow, perfectly constant speed: no acceleration, no shake, no cuts, no zoom, no fades. Vertical lines stay vertical.

**Style:** Ultra-premium architectural cinematography, photoreal, large-format cinema camera, 24mm spherical lens, 24fps with natural motion blur. Monochrome near-black palette of charcoal stone, honed black basalt, black-stained oak, smoked glass and brushed dark bronze. Lit only by warm 2700K concealed linear lighting and soft blue-hour light from outside, with creamy warm highlights and deep, clean shadows. Glossy surfaces carry long, soft reflections. Calm, silent, expensive. Fine film grain, gentle contrast, no saturated colours.

**Avoid:** No people, animals, text, logos, signage, screens or TVs. No lens flares, flicker, morphing or melting furniture, sudden lighting changes or fisheye distortion.

---

## Clip 1 — Arrival (Text to Video)

A single continuous 8-second shot. The camera glides slowly forward down a long, perfectly symmetrical entrance gallery inside a dark modern luxury house: tall walls of textured charcoal stone, a polished black basalt floor reflecting thin lines of warm light set into the ceiling and along the base of the walls. At the far end, a tall open pivot door of dark bronze frames a glimpse of a double-height living room glowing softly with warm light, with blue-hour sky beyond. The centre of the frame stays deep and dark at the start; as the camera advances, the doorway grows larger and the warm glow beyond becomes clearer. The shot ends mid-glide, just before the threshold, with the camera still moving forward.
